<title>USA: No damaging frost in sight in Brazil coffee belt.</title>
<headline>No damaging frost in sight in Brazil coffee belt.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight for the next seven days in Brazil's coffee areas, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Temperatures are expected to be near normal to slightly above normal in the next few days.</p>
<p>The outlook is for cooler weather on Sunday.</p>
</text>
